{comment: Intro}
[*bb-ab-g-eb-f-bb][Ab2]      [Bbsus]        [Ab2]      [*bb-ab-g-eb-f][Bbsus]        [Bb-Ab-G-Eb-F-Bb]                    [Bb-Ab-G-Eb-F]
{ci: (repeat)}

{comment: Verse}
[Ab2]All the saints and an[Bbsus]gels
[Ab2]Bow before your [Bbsus]throne
[Ab2]All the elders [Bbsus]cast their [Eb/G]crowns
Before the [Ab2]Lamb of [Bbsus]God and [Eb]sing

{comment: Chorus}
[*bb-ab-g-eb]
{ci: (repeat 4x)}
You're worthy of it [Eb]all[Bb-Ab-G-Eb]
[*bb-f-eb-d]
{ci: (repeat 4x)}
You're worthy of it [Bbsus]all[Bb]
For from you [Eb/G]are all  [Ab2]things
And to you [Cm]are all [Bb]things
You deserve the [Eb]glory

{comment: Turnaround}
[Ab2]       [Bbsus]         [Ab2]       [Bbsus]

{comment: Interlude}
[Eb]      [Ebmaj7/G]             [Cm]      [Ab2]
{ci: (Play 'day and night, night and day')}
/[*eb-f-g]     /     [*eb-f-g]/     /[*eb]
/[*d-eb]     /   [*bb]  /     /

{comment: Bridge}
[Eb]Day and night, night and day     Let in[Ebmaj7/G]cense arise
[Cm]Day and night, night and day     Let in[Ab2]cense arise
[Eb/Bb]Day and night, night and day     Let in[Bb]cense arise
[Fm7]Day and night, night and day     Let in[Ab2]cense arise
{ci: (repeat)}

